<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Offline - PHONEPHIX GAMES</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .offline-container {
            max-width: 400px;
        }
        .offline-container i {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #00ff88;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .offline-container h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .offline-container p {
            color: #aaa;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #00ff88;
            color: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #00cc6a;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .btn i {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
            color: #0a0a0a;
        }
        .btn i:hover {
            color: #0a0a0a;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="offline-container">
        <i class="fas fa-wifi"></i>
        <h1>📡 You're Offline</h1>
        <p>
            Oops! It seems you've lost your internet connection.
            Please check your network and try again.
        </p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="location.reload()">
            <i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Retry Connection
        </button>
        <br><br>
        <a href="/" class="btn" style="background: #2a2a2a; color: #fff;">
            <i class="fas fa-home"></i> Go to Homepage
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
